  "design": [
    "Generic Core optional retained host stack-policy callback receives realm global, original error and genuine captured CallSites. Core hosts without the hook preserve existing behavior. Success caches returned value; throws leave captured stack available for retry.",
    "Node owns policy via ORIGINAL configured prepareStackTraceCallback and public ErrorPrepareStackTrace. Internal override WeakMap dispatch precedes user hook selection; actual private Node error symbol is captured at bootstrap, independent of later export poisoning.",
    "UDP buffer errors construct actual configured ERR_SOCKET_BUFFER_SIZE class; original context accessors, class identity and inspection algorithm own results. No error-name/constructor spoof.",
    "Build derives process.version and versions.node from actual bundled src/node_version.h. Rust owns metadata descriptors; duplicated JavaScript version defaults and incorrect freezing removed.",
    "Normal shared merge198b79e31 includes dense push/pop lane and static linker order; fresh Core648 and API349 qualify combined behavior."
  ],
